{"source":"\u0022\u0022\u0022Module-level functions that call each other, recursion, and helpers whose types come from their calls. Written for this repository.\u0022\u0022\u0022\n\n\ndef _square(x):\n    return x * x\n\n\ndef _half(x):\n    return x / 2\n\n\ndef sum_of_squares(a: int, b: int) -\u003E int:\n    return _square(a) \u002B _square(b)\n\n\ndef hypotenuse_squared(a: float, b: float) -\u003E float:\n    return a * a \u002B b * b\n\n\ndef halves(a: int) -\u003E float:\n    return _half(a) \u002B _half(a \u002B 1)\n\n\ndef factorial(n: int) -\u003E int:\n    if n \u003C= 1:\n        return 1\n    return n * factorial(n - 1)\n\n\ndef fibonacci(n: int) -\u003E int:\n    a, b = 0, 1\n    for _ in range(n):\n        a, b = b, a \u002B b\n    return a\n\n\ndef is_even(n: int) -\u003E bool:\n    if n == 0:\n        return True\n    return is_odd(n - 1)\n\n\ndef is_odd(n: int) -\u003E bool:\n    if n == 0:\n        return False\n    return is_even(n - 1)\n\n\ndef ackermann(m: int, n: int) -\u003E int:\n    if m == 0:\n        return n \u002B 1\n    if n == 0:\n        return ackermann(m - 1, 1)\n    return ackermann(m - 1, ackermann(m, n - 1))\n\n\ndef count_down(n: int) -\u003E None:\n    while n \u003E 0:\n        n -= 1\n\n\ndef uses_none_function(n: int) -\u003E int:\n    count_down(n)\n    return n\n\n\ndef mean(a: float, b: float, c: float) -\u003E float:\n    total = a \u002B b \u002B c\n    return total / 3\n\n\ndef adler32_step(a: int, b: int, byte: int) -\u003E int:\n    a = (a \u002B byte) % 65521\n    b = (b \u002B a) % 65521\n    return (b \u003C\u003C 16) | a\n","dump":{"format":1,"module":{"_":"Module","body":[{"_":"Expr","line":1,"col":1,"endLine":1,"endCol":138,"value":{"_":"Constant","line":1,"col":1,"endLine":1,"endCol":138,"kind":"str","value":"Module-level functions that call each other, recursion, and helpers whose types come from their calls. Written for this repository."}},{"_":"FunctionDef","line":4,"col":1,"endLine":5,"endCol":17,"name":"_